#### Decision Variables
- $x_i \in \mathbb{Z}_+, \quad \forall i \in I$  
  Number of units of product $i$ to fulfill (non-negative integer).

#### Objective
\[
\max \sum_{i \in I} A_i \cdot x_i
\]

